WEBVTT

NOTE Clip from "In Support of Services for People with Intellectual Disabilities" (Fikir Ethiopia). The speech is translated into English, taken from the original video's subtitles.

1
00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:03.000
My name is Kirubel Anteneh,

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.000
and I am a young man
with an intellectual disability.

3
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.500
It was discovered when I started having
difficulties understanding lessons

4
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:14.000
after I entered first grade,
following kindergarten.

5
00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:16.800
When a child with
an intellectual disability

6
00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:20.500
is born into your family,
life can become very difficult.

7
00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:22.500
Schools refuse to accept them,

8
00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:26.000
and there are few places equipped
to support their needs.

9
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Kirubel and I went through
many challenges together.
